<title>CANADA: Onex Corp Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>Onex Corp Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.02		   C$1.07</p>
<p> Net			    500		   39,800</p>
<p> Revs		   2,144,000		1,738,300</p>
<p>	   9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$1.18		   C$2.05</p>
<p> Net			 43,400		   76,100</p>
<p> Revs		   6,366,300		4,490,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Note: Third-quarter and year to date results in 1995 restated due to Sky Chefs reallocating some costs to the third quarter of 1995, rather than the 1995's fourth quarter as previously stated. The full year 1995 results are unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
